#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-locosys.rst:7
#: 42c8faa30dbd4c1ab5d3ebd85f4073dd
msgid "HAWK R1 and R2 (with compass) is a L1+L5 dual-frequency RTK centimeter-level GNSS receiver designed for UAV applications. The receiver is capable of concurrently tracking global civil navigation systems, including GPS, GLONASS, GALILEO, BEIDOU and QZSS. It acquires both L1 and L5 signals at a time while providing the centimeter-level RTK positioning accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-locosys.rst:16
#: d21447ff6fa44377855e55ed8e7ca685
msgid "HAWK R1 and R2 GNSS requires L1 and L5 RTCM GNSS correction data for a stable RTK fix"
